---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant DB as Evaluators DB

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo evaluator publish
    activate Vigilo

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Compile and validate WASM
    Vigilo->>DB: Check evaluator version uniqueness
    DB-->>Vigilo: Version available

    Vigilo->>DB: Check evaluator hash uniqueness
    DB-->>Vigilo: Hash available

    Vigilo->>DB: Insert evaluator WASM and metadata
    DB-->>Vigilo: Saved

    Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    deactivate Vigilo
